From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy: add the A733

The A733 device tree already describes its USB PHY as
"allwinner,sun60i-a733-usb-phy" with "allwinner,sun20i-d1-usb-phy" as
fallback, but the binding does not list the A733, so dtbs_check rejects
the node.

Add it next to the A100 and A523, which use the same fallback. The D1
fallback stays functional: a kernel that only knows the D1 runs the
A733 PHY, but with INCR8 host bursts, which fail under memory load. The
following patch selects INCR16 for the A733 compatible in the driver.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml    | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
index 580c3296a..da4ad6fb3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/allwinner,sun50i-a64-usb-phy.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun50i-a100-usb-phy
               - allwinner,sun55i-a523-usb-phy
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-usb-phy
           - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-usb-phy
 
   reg:
